E AX3043 1008-error-payload-untyped.ax:20:25-27 error-payload-untyped "storing a `String` through a field declared `Int` hides it from the release walk, which follows declared types" #"this holds a `String`" !"an `Int` slot holding a reference is invisible to reclamation, and leaks (error-model.md ERR-TYPE-5/ERR-MEM-1)" ?"declare the field's real type"
