E AX3073 1008-error-payload-untyped.ax:20:25-27 undeclared-unsafe "`main` erases `String` into `Int` with `as`, and its declaration does not say so" #"erases a reference" ^20:28-29:"source has type `String`; the conversion drops its ownership" ?15:1:"write `;@axiom:effect(unsafe)` above the declaration"~>";@axiom:effect(unsafe)\n" ?"keep the value in a typed binding, or use `addrOf` when the question is identity. An erasing cast drops the type and the share" ?"the unsafe tag marks a trusted boundary: you must make every well-typed call safe. It leaves ordinary type, effect and restriction checks in place"
